# Omarchy files origaiTV is allowed to change, one path per line. ADR-021 allows
# one at most, logo.txt, and only if no overlay or build step can do it. None
# is needed so far.

# GitHub reads a repo's security policy and its issue forms from .github/,
# and Omarchy's sent origaiTV's reports to Omarchy's address, tracker and
# Discord. These three are origaiTV's own instead (ADR-086), and nothing else
# may join them on that ground. The Omarchy sync keeps origaiTV's version of
# each, whatever upstream does to its own (.github/scripts/omarchy-sync).
.github/SECURITY.md
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/bug.yml
.github/ISSUE_TEMPLATE/config.yml
